Package: echosketch
Version: @VERSION@
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36)
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Shawn Rapaz <info@shoukugames.org>
Homepage: https://shoukugames.org/
Description: sound matching game for young children (ages 3+)
 EchoSketch plays a real-world sound - a dog, a doorbell, a fire truck -
 and the child picks the matching cartoon picture from four choices.
 Every answer is spoken aloud and spelled letter by letter so children
 connect the sound, the picture, the spoken word and its spelling.
 .
 Fully playable in English or Japanese (Japanese speech, and spelling
 kana by kana).
 .
 Levels grow harder, each round has a 99 second timer, and a grown-ups
 area shows each player's progress and the sounds they found tricky.
